The '''Glacial Cave''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|Collect Ice without the threat of a watery grave.|Collect long lost buried items!}}
== Features ==
'''Glacial Cave''' features multiple attractions.

=== Penguins ===
Scattered throughout the '''Glacial Cave''' are penguins. They wield a {{Item|Wooden Pickaxe}} and stand on the scaffold found across the caves. The penguins have idle dialogue and mention {{NPCSprite|Hendrik}}, who can be found in the {{zone|Hot Springs}}.

=== Frozen Treasure ===
Anywhere between {{Green|1}} and {{Green|4}} Frozen Treasures spawn every {{Green|10}} seconds at given locations within the ice in the '''Glacial Cave'''. The player can obtain Frozen Treasures by breaking the Ice Blocks they are inside of. 

The message when player find a treasure is:{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&3&lFROZEN TREASURE!&r You found &a<treasure>&f!}}}}
